    "切换语言会关闭并重新打开所有主窗口。请先保存每个已打开 PDF 的修改，否则未保存的内容将会丢失。" : {
      "comment" : "A description of the alert that appears when the user tries to change the app's language.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en-US" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Changing the language will close and reopen all main windows. Save changes to each open PDF first, or any unsaved changes will be lost."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "切换语言会关闭并重新打开所有主窗口。请先保存每个已打开 PDF 的修改，否则未保存的内容将会丢失。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "切換語言會關閉並重新開啟所有主視窗。請先儲存每個已開啟PDF的修改，否則未儲存的內容將會遺失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "切换语言后，所有主窗口将自动重新打开。" : {
      "comment" : "A description of the effect of switching the interface language.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "en-US" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "All main windows will reopen automatically after you change the language."
